  "details": "Upon opening the Radial menu, the 'Canvas' component gets disabled this is fine, however sometimes and won't toggle back on.\n\nWorld showcasing this problem, by forcing it to get re-enabled:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_3abace88-a781-451d-ae0c-6c11deebdd58\n\nthis is happening on both live and beta, this problem did not happen a few updates ago.",
